MODULE: NoAbortedPrepareFlushIgnoresDecision
TARGET: NoAbortedPrepare
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a staged prepare is flushed on an abort terminal instead of discarded
PERTURBS: Flush

--- FIND
    /\ view' = IF outcome = "commit" /\ source[bound] = 2
               THEN Winner(view, 2) ELSE view
--- REPLACE
    /\ view' = Winner(view, 2)
--- END
